MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_B01_m01_001: The special match between the White-Maned Demon\nand the Reaper is about to start.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c08_B01_m01: <BLN>The special match begins soon.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Aur_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Aur_m01_001: Cai, I heard that you were able to have an audience\nwith my father.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Aur_m01_002: It sounds as if he hasn't changed.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Aur_m01_003: Cai...do you think I look like my father?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Aur_m01_004: While you were at Yu Phas's temple, you met with\nsome children of Damascar, didn't you?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Aur_m01_005: I've wondered something about them for\na long time...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Aur_m01_006: How was my mother able to convince the Divine\nEmperor to spare the prisoners?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Aur_m01_007: What could she have offered to my grandfather,\nthat terrifying man?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Aur_m01_008: Oh, I really ought not to expose you to this kind of\ntalk. You are still just a child after all.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Aur_m01_009: I promise I'll make more of an effort to be more\nmotherly next time we talk.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c08_Aur_m01: <BLN>There's something I wonder...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Tia_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Tia_m01_001: So, what did you think of the Divine Sovereign?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Tia_m01_002: <NCA>Say he seemed nice.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Tia_m01_003: <NCB>Ask for her best guess.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Tia_m01_004: Well, if you didn't have a bad feeling, then maybe\nI should keep a more open mind about him.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Tia_m01_005: I've been trying to see him in a positive light, yet I\ncan't help but be bothered by what we've learned.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Tia_m01_006: You know, given how he's treated both your\nmom and dad.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Tia_m01_007: He didn't seem interested in meeting with\nAurora again, did he?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Tia_m01_008: I wonder, if we had the opportunity to speak,\nwhether my poor opinion of him would change.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c08_Tia_m01: <BLN>The Divine Sovereign...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Pet_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Pet_m01_001: So the main matches are finally about to start, huh?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Pet_m01_002: I admit that when we're on an adventure, you make\nme feel confident.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Pet_m01_003: I feel like we can probably win the next round, Cai.\nI know I'm going to do everything I can to help.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Pet_m01_004: But, if we win the next match, then the one after\nthat will probably be against that scary lady.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Pet_m01_005: And...I don't like the idea of that. Maybe she'll do us\na favor and lose.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Pet_m01_006: That's why I'm going to root for Talimun's clan!
MID_LGA_1KAI_c08_Pet_m01: <BLN>It's finally about to start...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Hur_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Hur_m01_001: Never thought I'd be in the Heroic Games, let alone\nmake it to the main matches!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Hur_m01_002: Life's weird, huh? 
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Hur_m01_003: Thousands of clans entered, only eight get into the\nmain matches, and only one can win the top spot!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Hur_m01_004: I'm willing to bet that these games will go down in\nthe annals of the Dagdan Empire.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Hur_m01_005: Cai, please let me do everything I can to help you.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Hur_m01_006: I'm asking for the sake of Aurora more than\nanything else.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Hur_m01_007: But I really do want to help you save your dad.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Hur_m01_008: It's important to do everything you can for family.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c08_Hur_m01: <BLN>Life's weird...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Cen_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Cen_m01_001: That man in Leda's clan, Buccar...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Cen_m01_002: I had a feeling I'd seen him before, and I finally\nremembered when that was.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Cen_m01_003: More than 20 years ago now, but he was a capable\nman. As I recall, he was appointed a pilus prior.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Cen_m01_004: Yes. I'm sure of it now. He used to go by the name\nDemon Bear of Baphos.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Cen_m01_005: Back then, I was nothing more than a vulkan novice.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Cen_m01_006: But he and I were close in age, so I was vaguely\naware of him.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Cen_m01_007: I think he was transferred to Cydonia...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Cen_m01_008: Yes, that's right... It was definitely Cydonia.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c08_Cen_m01: <BLN>I finally remembered...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Cas_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Cas_m01_001: I heard you won your way into the final eight.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Cas_m01_002: Well, wow. You're a lot stronger than I'd guessed.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Cas_m01_003: That said...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Cas_m01_004: You know what? Never mind. It's nothing.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c08_Cas_m01_005: Just take care of yourself. Don't eat anything that'll\ngive you a stomachache before a match, OK?
MID_LGA_1KAI_c08_Cas_m01: <BLN>That's my boy!